entries[21218] = { ["name"] = "Blue Qiraji Resonating Crystal", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nMount\n(Account-wide)\nUse: Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount may only be summoned in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.\nEmits a high frequency sound, forcing a silithid tank to burrow out from its home beneath the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj. The silithid is obedient to the summoner and can be used as a mount within the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj. Any hostile action towards the rider forces the tank underground.\nRequires level 1 to 80 ( 80)\nRequires Apprentice Riding\n\n\"This (relatively) domesticated silithid is at home only in the desert sands of Ahn'Qiraj.\"\nDrop:\nWorld Drop\nLocation:\nTemple of Ahn'Qiraj" }
